Please execute the steps below to get ARC resources and set up the environment before running UVM tests:

1. Source env.sh and setup.sh to enter an ARC shell with the required licenses/tools.

   Go to <$VERIF_ROOT>/env directory.
   -> source env.sh
   -> source setup.sh
   (Note: may need to source these files in bash mode)

2. Run the standalone Makefile flow:

   cd <$VERIF_ROOT>
   make env
   make generate   # if DUT sim scripts are not already generated
   make compile
   make sim

   See <$VERIF_ROOT>/README.md for knobs and regress usage.
